=== I. what real clients send for an upper-case or trailing-dot host: the agent compares the raw strings, then normalized
raw        https://TARGET.OA.TEST/      curl: (35) TLS connect error: error:0A000126:SSL routines::unexpected eof while 
{"authority":"TARGET.OA.TEST:443","sni":"target.oa.test","result":"closed","reason":"server name differs from authority"}
raw        https://target.oa.test./     curl: (35) TLS connect error: error:0A000126:SSL routines::unexpected eof while 
{"authority":"target.oa.test.:443","sni":"target.oa.test","result":"closed","reason":"server name differs from authority"}
